    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "You have chosen the Janus, and are aware about the range of petrol and
    diesel engines. But now, we also offer the Janus with the clean, electric drivetrain.
    So, what\u2019s the right one for you? Match your lifestyle, and the type of
    journeys you most regularly undertake, to the drivetrain that\u2019s best for
    you!"
